B.u58. {"problem": "record_approval's precondition approved-only-if-checked and the invariant approved-commits-passed-their-checks still accept any commit with checks_passed == true, however old the check. The 24-hour freshness rule is only in approve_commit's checks-pass. The kernel records an approval of a commit whose check is days old, and approved-only-if-checked still states the old rule.", "where": "authoring.domain.yaml: record_approval precondition approved-only-if-checked; invariant approved-commits-passed-their-checks", "kind": "contradiction", "from": "llm"}
